# NFS exports - copy to exports.local and edit for this host
#
# Format: /path/to/share  client(options)
#
# Examples:
# /srv/nfs/media    192.168.1.0/24(rw,sync,no_subtree_check,no_root_squash)
# /srv/nfs/backups  192.168.1.0/24(rw,sync,no_subtree_check,no_root_squash)
#
# Ventoy disk image for a PiKVM, read-only is enough (see the site's pikvm setup scripts,
# e.g. ~/spaces/rws/infra/roc/pikvm, which put this in /etc/exports.d instead):
# /srv/nfs/pikvm    <pikvm-ip>(ro,sync,no_subtree_check,root_squash)
